{
  "_comment": "The Night Watchman watchlist (UNVERIFIED SEED). Calibrate against a real owned unit in a lab before survey use. Patterns are Python regular expressions, matched case-insensitively against the SSID, the Bluetooth advertised name, and the vendor name Kismet (or the optional IEEE CSV) gives for the MAC prefix. A match is a hypothesis, never a finding. Edit freely; every pattern is validated at start-up.",
